  "bm_dome + bm_dome_ring: footprint = circle of RADIUS 8 tiles (diameter 16 tiles = 512 world px = 25.6 m). Server/engine radius must be 256 px (bmCfg.domeTiles = 8 as radius) both for rendering and for inDome.",
  "art_scale 2: 1 art px = 2 world px. Draw quads at size_m (dome billboard 25.8 x 24.0 m, ground ring 25.8 x 25.8 m; circle inside = 25.6 m) with NearestFilter; anchor = base-circle centre. Billboard centre sits (anchor_y-0.5)*h = 0.9 m above the anchor in screen-up.",
  "Opacity per viewer (engine side): local player OUTSIDE the dome -> opacity 0.9 (10% transparent, inside faintly visible); local player INSIDE -> opacity 0.5. Glow layer scaled by the same opacity.",
  "d256/g256/g256x have 15 columns: frame i -> col i%15, row anims.row + i//15 on the sheet named in anims.sheet. Ring loop is on g256, ring spawn+collapse on g256x (split to keep sheets <= 4096 px)."
